      "title": "Handoff and power protection",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This separate NUT view is prepared for the NAS USB data handoff. **The existing APC dashboard remains the current source until real NAS readings are verified.**\n\nMonitoring does not establish shutdown protection. No shutdown policy or UPS output command is controlled here. Runtime is an estimate; missing readings remain unavailable. [Existing APC readings and history](/d/apc-ups)"
